<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria 28-day discount T-bill issue 4.0 pct sold.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria 28-day discount T-bill issue 4.0 pct sold.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry issue of 3.8 billion levs of 28-day discount T-bills was four percent sold, yielding 247.35 percent, the Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) said.</p>
<p>Six financial institutions took part in Friday's auction, the BNB said in a statement.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> Issue number		BG3017796007</p>
<p> Type			  Discount</p>
<p> Par value		   3.8 bln levs</p>
<p> Auction date		Sept 13, 1996</p>
<p> Issue date		  Sept 19, 1996</p>
<p> Maturity date	     Oct 17, 1996</p>
<p> Bids received	     292.45 million levs</p>
<p> Avg price of bids	 90.69 pct</p>
<p> Bids approved	     152 million levs</p>
<p> Avg accepted price	90.89 pct</p>
<p> Yield to maturity	 10.02 pct</p>
<p>Cumulative annual yield 247.35 pct -- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
